Moritz filed a lawsuit against Universal Pictures for breach of oral contract and committing promissory fraud related to his role
on Hobbs & Shaw, which was eventually settled in September 2020 and he received a producer credit on F9 (2021).

20
01:49:36,000 --> 01:49:42,000
An international co-production between the United States and Japan, Hobbs & Shaw premiered at the Dolby Theatre in Hollywood
on July 13, 2019, and was theatrically released by Universal Pictures in the United States on August 2, 2019.

21
01:55:04,800 --> 01:55:10,800
It received mixed reviews from critics, who praised its action sequences and the chemistry between
Johnson and Statham, but found it underwhelming when compared to other Fast & Furious films.

22
02:00:33,600 --> 02:00:39,600
It was a box office success, grossing $760.7 million
worldwide on a budget of $200 million.

23
